{'symbol': 'L', 'date': '2022-10-31 06:20:00', 'title': 'LOEWS HOTELS & CO APPOINTS ALEX TISCH CEO', 'text': 'JONATHAN TISCH TO BECOME EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN NEW YORK , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOEWS\xa0HOTELS & CO, A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF\xa0LOEWS\xa0CORPORATION (NYSE:\xa0L), ANNOUNCED THAT ALEX TISCH WILL ASSUME THE ROLE OF CEO, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023.\xa0 IN HIS NEW ROLE, ALEX WILL CONTINUE TO WORK CLOSELY WITH JONATHAN TISCH, WHO WILL BECOME EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN, WHILE REMAINING A MEMBER OF THE OFFICE OF THE PRESIDENT AND CO-CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF LOEWS CORPORATION.'}{'symbol': 'L', 'date': '2022-10-31 06:10:00', 'title': 'LOEWS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES MANAGEMENT CHANGES AT LOEWS HOTELS & CO: JONATHAN TISCH TO ASSUME EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN POSITION; ALEX TISCH TO BECOME PRESIDENT AND CEO', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOEWS CORPORATION (NYSE: L) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT CEO JONATHAN (JON) TISCH WILL ASSUME THE ROLE OF EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN AND ALEX TISCH WILL BECOME PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JAN. 1, 2023. JON TISCH WILL REMAIN CO-CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF LOEWS CORPORATION, SERVING ALONG WITH ANDREW TISCH.'}{'symbol': 'L', 'date': '2022-10-31 06:00:00', 'title': 'LOEWS CORPORATION REPORTS NET INCOME OF $130 MILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOEWS CORPORATION (NYSE:L) TODAY REPORTED NET INCOME OF $130 MILLION, OR $0.54 PER SHARE, FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2022, COMPARED TO NET INCOME OF $220 MILLION, OR $0.85 PER SHARE, IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021. NET INCOME FOR THE NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2022 WAS $648 MILLION, OR $2.64 PER SHARE, COMPARED TO NET INCOME OF $1.2 BILLION, OR $4.70 PER SHARE, FOR THE NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021.'}